---
---

<section class="scene scene-freedom" id="freedom" style="flex-direction: column;">
  <div class="legend-card left" style="top: 20%;">
    <div class="legend-portrait placeholder">GW</div>
    <div class="legend-info">
      <div class="legend-name">Granville T. Woods</div>
      <div class="legend-years">1856 &ndash; 1910</div>
      <div class="legend-desc">&ldquo;Black Edison.&rdquo; Railway telegraph, electric railway. 60+ patents.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="legend-card right" style="top: 75%;">
    <div class="legend-portrait legend-portrait-archival">
      <img src="/images/cj-walker.webp" alt="Madam C.J. Walker" width="80" height="80" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="legend-info">
      <div class="legend-name">Madam C.J. Walker</div>
      <div class="legend-years">1867 &ndash; 1919</div>
      <div class="legend-desc">First female self-made millionaire in America. Hair care empire built from nothing.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="timeline-year reveal reveal-slow" aria-hidden="true">1865</div>
  <div style="max-width: 800px; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
    <div class="scene-divider reveal" style="margin-bottom: 40px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #55ac64, #D4A843);"></div>
    <p class="reveal font-display" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 24px;">June 19th, 1865.</p>
    <p class="reveal font-display" style="font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px); font-weight: 300; color: #55ac64; margin-bottom: 40px;">Galveston, Texas. The last to hear the news.</p>
    <p class="reveal font-body" style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 2; opacity: 0.6; max-width: 580px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
      Two and a half years after the Emancipation Proclamation, Union soldiers arrived in Texas to announce that enslaved people were free. Freedom, delayed &mdash; but not denied.
    </p>

    <figure class="scene-image img-archival reveal scale-in ken-burns" style="margin: 40px 0;">
      <img src="/images/emancipation-day-1900-800.webp"
           srcset="/images/emancipation-day-1900-400.webp 400w, /images/emancipation-day-1900-800.webp 800w"
           sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 800px"
           alt="Emancipation Day celebration, June 19, 1900"
           width="800" height="623"
           loading="lazy" style="max-height: 50vh; object-fit: cover; width: 100%; border-radius: 12px;" />
      <figcaption>Emancipation Day celebration, June 19, 1900. Public domain.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <!-- Animated chain shatter -->
    <div class="chain-break chain-animated reveal" style="margin: 48px 0; opacity: 0.5;">
      <div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div><div class="chain-link"></div>
      <div class="chain-flash"></div>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal reveal-slow font-display" style="font-size: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 26px); font-weight: 400; color: #D4A843; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 1px;">
      The chains broke. The building began.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
